るのが大好きな子です。\nこれだけではちょっと説明が足りないと思いますので設定と設定画など、ご参考できそうなものを下のURLにまとめております。\n\nこの娘でえまごろう様の絵柄でのgifアニメをどうかお願いしたいです。\nスケブのナズリンの絵のようなデフォルメ姿で、設定画の部屋着姿で、ペンギンのぬいぐるみを持ってダラダラしてるのがみたいです。\nご検討くださいませ！\n\nお忙しい中、要件のみで申し訳ありません。\n応援しております！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kVcp6B8dzGYFGpFb9spMTyDnz0TzyM7Q?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tasoema416/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 305594, "client_id": 1941461, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e4c87c28cd780dca5380c269eacc665", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e4c87c28cd780dca5380c269eacc665, https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cfff36647983241b6b6dec2cbff9628 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f6c754faa8750561d8446570b9ed3b8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a652f0eb94acf3285cbda8c07e545421", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a652f0eb94acf3285cbda8c07e545421, https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=218d782b38bc871c9d3a35d2ec41a1f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83c47cd4/uploads/origins/e6331a67-cfa1-40bb-9a72-2cf59c3501d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f60d18a1c8c0c09d9f2c362a5bd2a5de 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品を見つけたばかりで、とても気に入っています。私のOCの弟ペンギンが他のペンギンと遊んでいるところを描いていただけませんか？ポーズや背景はお任せします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/116So_AVrbju-wjOZAq4jAn5pFu5P0qS9/view", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tasoema416/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 305594, "client_id": 1033583, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23cee5f48d3b56846cd3ba00cc1b203e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23cee5f48d3b56846cd3ba00cc1b203e, https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32f3daf65797fa95d545e7fd0c392b0e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e482323e09d62ba0e65771c91ff5877 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=326593df483a77d07a905219df493e8c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=326593df483a77d07a905219df493e8c, https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a6c686fbece9eb55dfa804cda8458c4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31daaa01/uploads/origins/89194761-fc86-4bcf-a2b3-d525ac960b65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5efccd15e6b80e94751537189c3c2206 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\n\nAs a fellow fan of penguins, I've always loved seeing the art you post on Twitter and would love to request you!\n\nMy VTuber is an evil emperor penguin set on ruling world with a large ego and extreme overconfidence!\n\nI'd like for the art to be of my character sat on a throne in a throne room with other penguins either wearing armour or setting up other things in the room! Such as banners or tables, think of it like a typical medieval setting!\n\nBut please feel free to experiment! Thanks!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GkBSL5R1Ht7kxRGdOzlZFHgie5yH8gJR?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tasoema416/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 305594, "client_id": 20281, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed0e9c55/uploads/origins/ccd2fd43-ebb0-4da3-b000-701dc5357baa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1b4cb536b9574c6213067dab3061366", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed0e9c55/uploads/origins/ccd2fd43-ebb0-4da3-b000-701dc5357baa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1b4cb536b9574c6213067dab3061366, https://si.imgix.net/ed0e9c55/uploads/origins/ccd2fd43-ebb0-4da3-b000-701dc5357baa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0be92cf09